[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランツェさんの演説聞きたかったなぁ。\nあの人も航海で大変な目にあってたなんて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I really wanted to hear Lanze's speech. I had no idea he'd been through so much out at sea."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様の気持ちを分かってくれる人だった……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "He understood what you went through..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランツェさんはフロッケ号で、私たちはバーバラ号。\nその前はアルビ号だったからなかなか話す機会がね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze was on the Flocke, and we were on the Barbara. Before that it was the Alvie, so we never really had much chance to talk..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……男は自分の失敗を\n他人にあまり話さないものさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Men don't tend to share their failures with others."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "別に、男に限らないと思うけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don't think that's limited to men."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……まあ、そういう説もある",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Fair enough."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ジョゼさん、ぜんぜん釣れてないですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You haven't caught a thing, José."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "海の魚は気まぐれなのさ。\nじっくりと向き合って、ようやく微笑んでくれる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fish are fickle creatures. You have to be patient with them before they'll smile back at you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "魚釣り、そんなに難しくない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fishing isn't that hard."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だったら勝負してみるかい？\u3000もし嬢ちゃんが\n先に釣ったら、この仮面を外してあげよう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh yeah? Care to make it a contest? If you reel one in before I do, I'll take off my mask."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……乗った",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Deal."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "また変な勝負を始めて……ん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There they go again with some weird bet... hmm?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "泳いでる魚の口に向かって、針をかける……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just have to angle the hook right toward the fish's mouth..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "一丁上がり",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Done."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "また力技な……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brute force as always..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ベップちゃんがいれば、\n海の上でも食事の心配はないわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "With Bepp around, at least we won't have to worry about meals at sea."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "参った、俺の完敗だ。\n約束通り、仮面を外そう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I concede. A total loss. A bet's a bet—I'll take off my mask."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, really!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "秘技・二重仮面",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Secret technique: Double Mask."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な、なんの意味が……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wh-what's the point of..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから仮面を外すなんて条件で勝負を挑んだのね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So that's why you were willing to bet the mask in the first place..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "フッ、残念だったね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heh. Better luck next time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんだか、寒くなってきちゃった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I suddenly feel a chill."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほら、ジョゼのネタがつまらなかったから\n被害者が出てきちゃいましたよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "See? José's terrible jokes are already claiming victims."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "被害者って……アルビーナも結構言うよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "\"Victims\"... you don't pull your punches either, Alvina."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それもあるかもだけど、原因はあれかも……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That might be part of it, but I think the real cause is that..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "流氷……オーベンランドが近いんだわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Drift ice. We must be getting close to Obenland."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "オーベンランド……暗黒の氷海があった……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Obenland... where the Midnight Sea is..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "話には聞いてる……大丈夫か？\nアルビーナの嬢ちゃんは",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've heard about it... You doing okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫……そう言えるように、してきたつもり",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm fine... I've been trying to make sure I can say that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]